<title>USA: Hallwood Energy accepts Hallwood Group offer.</title>
<headline>Hallwood Energy accepts Hallwood Group offer.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hallwood Energy Corp said its directors accepted Hallwood Group Inc's offer to combine the two companies.</p>
<p>Under the proposed deal, Hallwood Energy's minority shareholders would receive $19.50 a share for each of their Hallwood Energy shares, the company said.</p>
<p>Hallwood Group currently owns about 82 percent of Hallwood Energy.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close by year-end, but remains subject to shareholder approval and execution of a definitive agreement, the company said.</p>
<p>Hallwood Energy Corp is the general partner of Hallwood Energy Partners LP.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
